{"type":"message","id":"cd13e997","parentId":"a73dc681","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:17:50.299Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-a5876055-9eaf-4888-9dc5-5afbbeea03d1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"NVIDIA NIM API rate limit requests per minute\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1144,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fc8463bc71221200\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAPI Rate Limit Increase for NVIDIA NIM\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"fc8463bc71221200\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://forums.developer.nvidia.com/t/api-rate-limit-increase-for-nvidia-nim/366043\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"09f4dde2822b2204\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHello NVIDIA team, I am currently using the NVIDIA API ( NIM ) for a project and I have reached the default rate limit of 40 Requests Per Minute .Could you please assist in reviewing my account and increasing the quota? Thank you for your support.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"09f4dde2822b2204\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"forums.developer.nvidia.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"49d7b4871f50438f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nUnderstanding NVIDIA NIM API Catalog: Traffic Limits and Usage Quotas\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"49d7b4871f50438f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://fungather.com/article/201/understanding-nvidia-nim-api-catalog-traffic-limits-and-usage-quotas.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3d01731444e1df91\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThis article details the traffic limitations for using the NVIDIA NIM API Catalog, part of the Build AI initiative. Discover the confirmed rate limits (40 RPM), the opaque token restrictions, and how the free credit system works. Learn the critical next steps for engineers looking to scale beyond the trial phase.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3d01731444e1df91\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"fungather.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"360b783474cc9397\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNVIDIA NIM API Build流量限制全解析：免费API试用额度与速率限制详解 - 满银网\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"360b783474cc9397\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://alishui.com/article/100636/NVIDIA-NIM-API-Build-liu-liang-xian-zhi-quan-jie-xi-mian-fei-API-shi-yong-e-du-yu-su-l%C3%BC-xian-zhi-xiang-jie.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"df96b24ee1f80509\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n想了解 NVIDIA Build AI/ NIM API Catalog的流量限制吗？本文为您详细解读试用阶段的速率限制（RPM）、免费API积分获取方式以及不可公开的Token限制。掌握关键数据，合理规划您的AI模型调用，避免不必要的困扰!\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"df96b24ee1f80509\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"alishui.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"faf1ab0a96a335dc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNVIDIA NIM Free API: 100+ AI Models, Zero Cost, Real Limits\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"faf1ab0a96a335dc\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://aihola.com/article/nvidia-nim-free-api-models\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c1913b6838dd8f01\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNVIDIA's NIM catalog offers 100+ AI models via free API , from DeepSeek to Nemotron speech. Here's what developers actually get and what NVIDIA gets in return.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c1913b6838dd8f01\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"aihola.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1b411d8df335fe04\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nnim-explorer/docs/api-reference.md at main - GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id