{"type":"message","id":"5d7f4e89","parentId":"a08121d5","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:21:13.748Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fdd2aa164a8c27f9b6594d921b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 05:21 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fdd2aa164a8c27f9b6594d921b]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 升级到新版本5.19后需要为每个agent添加这个嘛：\n\"tools\": {\n \"allowlist\": [\"message\", \"channels\"]\n }"}],"timestamp":1779340873721}}
