{"type":"message","id":"f301520d","parentId":"972d2308","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:21:33.700Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've analyzed the OpenClaw 5.19 configuration schema and can confirm that **the configuration format you mentioned is not valid**.\n\n## What's Wrong with Your Example\n\n```json\n\"tools\": {\n  \"allowlist\": [\"message\", \"channels\"]\n}\n```\n\nThis syntax doesn't match the 5.19 schema because:\n\n1. ❌ **No `allowlist` field** — The correct field names are:\n   - `allow` - absolute allowlist (replaces profile defaults)\n   - `alsoAllow` - additive allowlist (adds to profile defaults)\n   - `deny` - denylist\n\n2. ❌ **`channels` is not a valid tool** — There's no tool called \"channels\". The tool you probably want is `message`.\n\n## Correct Configuration\n\nIf you want to allow the `message` tool for an agent:\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"your-agent-id\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"alsoAllow\": [\"message\"]\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOr if you want to restrict to ONLY the `message` tool (using `allow` instead of `alsoAllow`):\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"your-agent-id\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"profile\": \"minimal\",  // optional: base profile\n          \"allow\": [\"message\"]\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## If You're Seeing This in Documentation\n\nThis configuration pattern might be:\n- From an older version (before 5.19)\n- From a third-party guide or AI-generated suggestion\n- A misunderstanding of the field names\n\n**Could you share where you saw this configuration?** I can then help verify if it's outdated or if there's a specific use case I'm missing."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7-flash","usage":{"input":38175,"output":396,"cacheRead":4058,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":42629,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779340873781,"responseId":"2026052113211446a118c5605c4d2a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"df5224c9","parentId":"f301520d","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:23:13.646Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fdd253cf4acc2e90535772b97f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 05:23 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fdd253cf4acc2e90535772b97f]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 那你给我修正一下，然后中文回复"}],"timestamp":1779340993625}}
{"type":"message","id":"60545c53","parentId":"df5224c9","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:23:27.348Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的，我来帮你修正这个配置。\n\n## 问题分析\n\n你提到的配置：\n```json\n\"tools\": {\n  \"allowlist\": [\"message\", \"channels\"]\n}\n```\n\n**错误原因：**\n1. ❌ 字段名是 `allowlist`，但正确字段名是 `allow` 或 `alsoAllow`\n2. ❌ `channels` 不是有效的工具名\n3. ❌ 应该是 `message` 工具\n\n## 正确的配置方式\n\n### 方式 1：添加 message 工具（推荐）\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"your-agent-id\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"alsoAllow\": [\"message\"]\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 方式 2：只允许 message 工具（严格模式）\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"your-agent-id\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"profile\": \"minimal\",\n          \"allow\": [\"message\"]\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 方式 3：如果需要 message 的特定操作（如只允许发送）\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"your-agent-id\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"alsoAllow\": [\"message\"],\n          \"actions\": {\n            \"allow\": [\"send\"]  // 只允许发送操作\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 完整示例\n\n如果你有多个 agent，可以这样配置：\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"assistant\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"alsoAllow\": [\"message\"]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"coder\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"profile\": \"coding\",\n          \"allow\": [\"message\"]\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"messenger\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"profile\": \"messaging\",\n          \"alsoAllow\": [\"message\"]\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**需要我帮你直接修改 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` 文件吗？** 如果是的话，请告诉我：\n1. 你要修改哪个 agent 的配置\n2. 你希望这个 agent 有什么权限（只是允许 message，还是需要 coding、fs 等工具）"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7-flash","usage":{"input":42618,"output":519,"cacheRead":42,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43179,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779340993679,"responseId":"202605211323146a65f58125a14a65"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1ffe0cde","parentId":"60545c53","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:44:28.162Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fddf559d0a8c211a9854afe815\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 05:44 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fddf559d0a8c211a9854afe815]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 为什么需要这么配置呢"}],"timestamp":1779342268141}}
{"type":"message","id":"3f37ff15","parentId":"1ffe0cde","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:44:46.384Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好问题！让我解释一下为什么需要这么配置，以及它的作用。\n\n## 为什么需要配置 tools？\n\n### 1. **安全隔离（沙箱机制）**\n\nOpenClaw 默认会限制 agent 能使用的工具，防止 agent 执行危险操作：\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"messenger\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"profile\": \"messaging\"  // 只允许 messaging 相关工具\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"coder\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"profile\": \"coding\"     // 允许 coding 相关工具（fs、exec、web 等）\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. **不同 agent 有不同权限**\n\n想象一下你有很多不同的 agent：\n\n| Agent 类型 | 需要的权限 | tools 配置示例 |\n|-----------|-----------|----------------|\n| **消息助手** | 发送/读取消息 | `profile: \"messaging\"` |\n| **代码助手** | 读写文件、执行命令、搜索网络 | `profile: \"coding\"` |\n| **查询助手** | 只能搜索、读取内存 | `profile: \"minimal\"` |\n| **管理助手** | 所有权限（需要谨慎） | `profile: \"full\"` 或不配置 |\n\n### 3. **细粒度控制**\n\n你可以更精确地控制工具使用：\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"strict-coder\",\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"allow\": [\"read\", \"write\", \"edit\"],  // 只允许读写文件\n          \"deny\": [\"exec\", \"process\", \"web_search\"]  // 禁用危险操作\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. **按 provider 限制**\n\n不同渠道的 agent 可以有不同的权限：\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"byProvider\": {\n      \"feishu\": {\n        \"allow\": [\"message\"]  // 飞书渠道的 agent 只能发消息\n      },\n      \"discord\": {\n        \"allow\": [\"message\", \"web_search\"]  // Discord 的 agent 可以搜索\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 如果不配置会怎样？\n\n### 默认行为\n\n如果你不配置 `tools`，agent 会使用**默认策略**：\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"defaults\": {\n      \"tools\": {\n        \"profile\": \"coding\"  // 默认是 coding profile\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 默认 profile 包含的工具\n\n| Profile | 包含的工具 |\n|---------|-----------|\n| `minimal` | 只有 `session_status` |\n| `coding` | `group:fs`, `group:runtime`, `group:web`, `group:sessions`, `group:memory`, `cron`, `image`, `image_generate`, `video_generate` |\n| `messaging` | `group:messaging`, `sessions_list`, `sessions_history`, `sessions_send`, `session_status` |\n| `full` | 无限制（所有工具） |\n\n## 实际场景举例\n\n### 场景 1：公共群聊机器人\n```json5\n{\n  \"id\": \"public-bot\",\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"alsoAllow\": [\"message\"]  // 只能发消息，不能改文件或执行命令\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 场景 2：本地开发助手\n```json5\n{\n  \"id\": \"dev-assistant\",\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"profile\": \"coding\"  // 完整的 coding 能力\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 场景 3：只读查询助手\n```json5\n{\n  \"id\": \"query-bot\",\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"allow\": [\"web_search\", \"memory_search\", \"memory_get\"]  // 只能查询\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 总结\n\n**为什么需要配置？**\n\n1. ✅ **安全**：防止 agent 误操作危险工具（如 `exec`、`process`）\n2. ✅ **权限隔离**：不同 agent 有不同能力\n3. ✅ **灵活性**：可以精细控制每个工具的权限\n4. ✅ **合规性**：符合最小权限原则\n\n**如果你有多个 agent，建议：**\n- 公共/消息类 agent → `profile: \"messaging\"` 或 `allow: [\"message\"]`\n- 开发类 agent → `profile: \"coding\"`\n- 查询类 agent → `profile: \"minimal\"`\n- 管理/管理员 agent → `profile: \"full\"` 或自定义\n\n**需要我帮你根据你的具体需求设计配置吗？**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7-flash","usage":{"input":43193,"output":1002,"cacheRead":42,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44237,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779342268204,"responseId":"202605211344294246887744c74c94"}}
