{"type":"message","id":"94e86466","parentId":"5830fbb1","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:53:23.933Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fdd93c2e0acc4cd8c7874c0897\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 05:53 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fdd93c2e0acc4cd8c7874c0897]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: \"tools\": {\n \"profile\": \"coding\",\n \"agentToAgent\": {\n \"enabled\": true,\n \"allow\": [\n \"main\",\n \"lucus\",\n \"codus\",\n \"wxlee\"\n ]\n },\n \"sessions\": {\n \"visibility\": \"all\"\n },\n \"web\": {\n \"search\": {\n \"enabled\": true,\n \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\"\n }\n },\n \"subagents\": {\n \"tools\": {\n \"allow\": [\n \"read\",\n \"write\",\n \"exec\",\n \"process\"\n ]\n }\n }\n },\n原来的老版本中这个配置还有效吧，"}],"timestamp":1779342803911}}
{"type":"message","id":"18f7e33d","parentId":"94e86466","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:53:46.448Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看了你提供的这个配置，我来分析一下：\n\n## 配置分析\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"profile\": \"coding\",\n    \"agentToAgent\": {\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"allow\": [\"main\", \"lucus\", \"codus\", \"wxlee\"]\n    },\n    \"sessions\": {\n      \"visibility\": \"all\"\n    },\n    \"web\": {\n      \"search\": {\n        \"enabled\": true,\n        \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"subagents\": {\n      \"tools\": {\n        \"allow\": [\"read\", \"write\", \"exec\", \"process\"]\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 问题点\n\n### ❌ 1. `agentToAgent` 不在 `tools` 里面\n根据 schema，`agentToAgent` 是**独立的一级配置**，不是 `tools` 的子字段：\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"your-agent\",\n        \"agentToAgent\": {  // ← 这里，不是 tools 里面\n          \"enabled\": true,\n          \"allow\": [\"main\", \"lucus\", \"codus\", \"wxlee\"]\n        },\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"profile\": \"coding\",\n          \"sessions\": {\n            \"visibility\": \"all\"\n          },\n          \"web\": {\n            \"search\": {\n              \"enabled\": true,\n              \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"subagents\": {\n            \"tools\": {\n              \"allow\": [\"read\", \"write\", \"exec\", \"process\"]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ 2. `sessions.visibility` 不在 `tools` 里面\n这是 `agents.list[].sessions` 的配置，不是 `tools` 的：\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"your-agent\",\n        \"sessions\": {\n          \"visibility\": \"all\"\n        },\n        \"tools\": { ... }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### ✅ 3. `subagents.tools.allow` 是有效的\n这个配置是正确的，用于限制子 agent 的工具权限。\n\n## 正确的完整配置\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"your-agent-id\",\n        \"agentToAgent\": {\n          \"enabled\": true,\n          \"allow\": [\"main\", \"lucus\", \"codus\", \"wxlee\"]\n        },\n        \"sessions\": {\n          \"visibility\": \"all\"\n        },\n        \"tools\": {\n          \"profile\": \"coding\",\n          \"web\": {\n            \"search\": {\n              \"enabled\": true,\n              \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"subagents\": {\n            \"tools\": {\n              \"allow\": [\"read\", \"write\", \"exec\", \"process\"]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 关于老版本\n\n**是的，这些配置在老版本中应该是有效的**，但：\n\n1. **结构位置**：`agentToAgent` 和 `sessions.visibility` 不在 `tools` 里面，它们是独立的配置项\n2. **字段名称**：字段名本身没有变化\n3. **功能**：这些配置在 5.19 中仍然有效\n\n## 你的配置问题总结\n\n| 配置项 | 问题 | 正确位置 |\n|-------|------|---------|\n| `agentToAgent` | 在 `tools` 里面 ❌ | agent 级别配置 |\n| `sessions.visibility` | 在 `tools` 里面 ❌ | agent 级别配置 |\n| `subagents.tools.allow` | ✅ 正确 | `tools` 子配置 |\n| `web.search` | ✅ 正确 | `tools` 子配置 |\n\n**需要我帮你修正这个配置吗？**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7-flash","usage":{"input":40670,"output":836,"cacheRead":3908,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45414,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779342803968,"responseId":"20260521135324a452a8ba4e2b4777"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0d63e509","parentId":"18f7e33d","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:54:44.043Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fddacc01518c29c2c3a075a24e\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 05:54 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6fddacc01518c29c2c3a075a24e]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 之前的tools跟agents是平级的"}],"timestamp":1779342884007}}
{"type":"message","id":"ed302d02","parentId":"0d63e509","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:55:08.711Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你说得对！我理解错了。\n\n## 正确的结构\n\n`tools` 和 `agentToAgent` 确实是**平级**的，都在 agent 级别：\n\n```json5\n{\n  \"agents\": {\n    \"list\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"your-agent-id\",\n        \"agentToAgent\": {  // ← 平级配置\n          \"enabled\": true,\n          \"allow\": [\"main\", \"lucus\", \"codus\", \"wxlee\"]\n        },\n        \"sessions\": {\n          \"visibility\": \"all\"\n        },\n        \"tools\": {  // ← 平级配置\n          \"profile\": \"coding\",\n          \"web\": {\n            \"search\": {\n              \"enabled\": true,\n              \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\"\n            }\n          },\n          \"subagents\": {\n            \"tools\": {\n              \"allow\": [\"read\", \"write\", \"exec\", \"process\"]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 配置层级结构\n\n```\nagents\n└── list\n    └── [agent]\n        ├── id\n        ├── agentToAgent\n        ├── sessions\n        └── tools\n```\n\n所以你的配置**结构是正确的**，我之前说的\"在 tools 里面\"是错的。\n\n## 那关于 \"allowlist\" 的问题呢？\n\n你之前问的：\n\n```json\n\"tools\": {\n  \"allowlist\": [\"message\", \"channels\"]\n}\n```\n\n这个**仍然有问题**，因为：\n1. ❌ 字段名是 `allowlist`，但正确的是 `allow` 或 `alsoAllow`\n2. ❌ `channels` 不是有效的工具名\n\n**你现在的配置示例中没有 `allowlist`，所以没问题。**\n\n需要我帮你检查具体的配置文件吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7-flash","usage":{"input":41417,"output":384,"cacheRead":4058,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45859,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779342884074,"responseId":"20260521135445dbc0bb04a17b45d2"}}
