{"type":"message","id":"f9c4b772","parentId":"d5848adf","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:20:05.605Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"让我检查 lucus 的工作空间和最近的备份任务配置："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9329146d215a4ad1a68bb00c","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/HEARTBEAT.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/HEARTBEAT.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5c0b18ceca1f4d8cb60cbe8f","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/MEMORY.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/MEMORY.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0e37453f9c834a658ce2e544","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"ls -la /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7-flash","usage":{"input":6847,"output":80,"cacheRead":52628,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59555,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779391201314,"responseId":"202605220320026599317972d84fdd"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a9ffa422","parentId":"f9c4b772","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:20:05.712Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9329146d215a4ad1a68bb00c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Heartbeat Tasks\n\n## 节点状态检查\n\n每2小时检测一次节点状态：\n- 有异常 → 立即汇报\n- 无异常 → 静默\n\n每天上午10点发送一次状态摘要（无论是否有异常）。\n\n### 检查项\n1. 节点连通性\n2. 节点资源使用率（CPU/内存/磁盘）\n3. 关键服务状态\n4. 日志异常检测\n5. Qitmeer节点运行状态（块高、在线状态、健康度）\n\n### 汇报规则\n- **紧急异常**：立即发送通知\n- **日常状态**：每天10:00发送一次汇总报告\n- **静默期**：23:00 - 08:00 期间非紧急问题延迟到早上汇报\n\n---\n\n## Qitmeer节点监控\n检查脚本路径：`scripts/check-qitmeer-node.sh`\n- 每2小时自动执行一次检查\n- 异常情况（API不可达、节点离线、健康状态异常）立即汇报\n- 每日10点状态汇总包含当前Qitmeer节点块高信息\n\n依赖：需要系统安装jq（JSON解析工具），安装命令：`apt install -y jq`\n\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779391205708}}
